# 🏦 Bank Management System

> A complete **Console-Based Bank Management System** developed in **Python** using **Object-Oriented Programming (OOP)** concepts and **JSON** as the backend database.

---

## 📖 Project Overview

The **Bank Management System** is a menu-driven banking application that simulates real-world banking operations through a command-line interface.

The project has been developed entirely in Python following Object-Oriented Programming principles while using JSON files for permanent data storage.

The system provides two different user roles:

- 👤 Customer
- 👨‍💼 Administrator

Customers can register, log in securely, manage multiple bank accounts, perform banking transactions, submit service requests, and receive notifications.

Administrators can securely log in and manage customers, accounts, transactions, and customer requests.

The project was developed as a backend-focused learning project to understand how real banking systems are designed without relying on SQL databases.

---

