# 💳 Banking Services

The application supports various banking services including:

- Cash Deposit
- UPI Deposit
- Cash Withdrawal
- UPI Withdrawal
- Cheque Deposit Request
- Cheque Withdrawal Request
- Money Transfer
- Balance Inquiry
- Transaction History

---

# 📋 Customer Services

Customers can submit service requests for:

- Phone Number Change
- Address Change
- Cheque Deposit
- Cheque Withdrawal
- Account Closure

Each request is sent to the administrator for approval.

---

# 📨 Notification System

The project includes a complete notification module.

Customers automatically receive notifications whenever:

- Money is deposited
- Money is withdrawn
- Money is transferred
- A request is approved
- A request is rejected
- Cheque is approved
- Cheque is rejected
- Account status changes

Every notification contains:

- Notification ID
- Account Number
- Title
- Message
- Status
- Timestamp

---

